---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sporty — Free Adult Intake"
  description="Provide your measurements to get free sport matches tailored to your body."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <style>
      .intake-shell {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(240px, 320px);
        align-items: start;
      }
      @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .intake-shell {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          padding-bottom: 5rem;
        }
      }
      @media (max-width: 620px) {
        .intake-shell {
          padding: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2.5rem) 1rem 5rem;
        }
      }
      .intake-flow {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      }
      .intake-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12), rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08));
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        border: 1px solid rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.18);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -32px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.38);
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.75rem;
      }
      .intake-banner__label {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--color-accent);
      }
      .intake-banner__headline {
        font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .intake-banner p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .intake-card {
        background: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
        box-shadow: 0 28px 54px -40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
      }
      .coach-ribbon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.12);
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .coach-ribbon--muted {
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
        color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.72);
      }
      .intake-card__header {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .intake-card__header > h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }
      .intake-card__header > p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .input-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .input-grid--two {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      }
      .input-grid--pairs {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      }
      .field {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }
      .field__label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      .field__hint {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .field input,
      .field select {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);
        background: #fff;
        font: inherit;
      }
      .input-pair {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.65rem;
      }
      .input-pair__head {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .input-pair__chip {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .input-pair__controls {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .input-pair__controls input[type='number'] {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);
        background: #fff;
        font: inherit;
      }
      .input-pair__controls input[type='range'] {
        width: 100%;
        accent-color: var(--color-accent);
      }
      .input-row {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      }
      .intake-card__actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .intake-card__empty {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .past-sports__items {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .past-sport-item {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
        padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .past-sport-flags {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      }
      .past-sport-picker {
        position: relative;
      }
      .past-sport-picker__results {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 0.4rem);
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 32px -24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
        max-height: 220px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        z-index: 10;
      }
      .past-sport-picker__results button {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: left;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 0.65rem;
        font: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .past-sport-picker__results button:hover {
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.1);
      }
      .premium-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .premium-note {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .premium-block {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .premium-header {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .premium-toggle {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.25);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      }
      .premium-toggle__copy {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.25rem;
      }
      .premium-toggle__title {
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .premium-toggle__hint {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .premium-header__badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      }
      .premium-groups {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
      .premium-group {
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.25);
        background: rgba(14, 165, 165, 0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .premium-group__header {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .premium-group__items {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.9rem;
      }
      .premium-item {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        align-items: end;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
        padding: 1rem;
      }
      .premium-item__note {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }
      .premium-empty {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
      }
      .intake-card--premium-locked {
        border: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      }
      .premium-lock {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .premium-lock__header {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .premium-lock__icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 2.5rem;
        height: 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.15);
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }
      .premium-lock__title {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }
      .premium-lock__copy {
        margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
        color: var(--color-muted);
        max-width: 540px;
      }
      .premium-lock__actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .intake-card--submit {
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
      .intake-card--submit .button-row {
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }
      .privacy-note {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .intake-aside {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 36px -30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3);
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .intake-aside h2 {
        margin: 0;
      }
      .intake-aside ul {
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.6rem;
      }
      .intake-sticky {
        position: fixed;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 20px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        z-index: 30;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .intake-sticky__inner {
        pointer-events: auto;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        background: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.25);
        box-shadow: 0 22px 44px -24px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.45);
      }
      .intake-sticky__label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .intake-sticky {
          width: calc(100% - 1.5rem);
          transform: translate(-50%, 0);
        }
        .intake-sticky__inner {
          justify-content: space-between;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </Fragment>
  <main class="intake-shell">
    <form class="intake-flow" data-intake-form>
      <header class="intake-banner">
        <span class="intake-banner__label">Free adult quick match</span>
        <h1 class="intake-banner__headline">Tell us about your body, we’ll do the rest.</h1>
        <p data-intake-banner>
          Share a handful of measurements and we’ll return your top three sports instantly. Log in and consent to save your results for later.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--basics">
        <span class="coach-ribbon">Step 1 · Basics</span>
        <div class="intake-card__header">
          <h2>Who are we measuring?</h2>
          <p>We use your birthday and sex to place you in the right cohort.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="input-grid input-grid--two">
          <label class="field">
            <span class="field__label">Birthday</span>
            <input type="date" name="birthday" required />
            <span class="field__hint">Used only to infer age brackets.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span class="field__label">Sex assigned at birth</span>
            <select name="sex" required>
              <option value="">Select one</option>
              <option value="female">Female</option>
              <option value="male">Male</option>
            </select>
            <span class="field__hint">Helps line you up with cohort averages.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--measurements">
        <span class="coach-ribbon">Step 2 · Body metrics</span>
        <div class="intake-card__header">
          <h2>Measurements</h2>
          <p>Every measurement below is required so we can benchmark you accurately. Keep a flexible tape handy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="input-grid input-grid--pairs">
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Height (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="height_cm" min="120" max="230" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="height_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="120" max="230" value="170" data-pair-range data-sync="height_cm" aria-label="Height slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Weight (kg)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="kg">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="weight_kg" min="35" max="200" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="weight_kg" />
              <input type="range" min="35" max="200" value="70" data-pair-range data-sync="weight_kg" aria-label="Weight slider (kilograms)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Arm span (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="arm_span_cm" min="100" max="250" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="arm_span_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="100" max="250" value="180" data-pair-range data-sync="arm_span_cm" aria-label="Arm span slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Leg inseam (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="leg_inseam_cm" min="50" max="130" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="leg_inseam_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="50" max="130" value="75" data-pair-range data-sync="leg_inseam_cm" aria-label="Leg inseam slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Shoulder width (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="shoulder_width_cm" min="30" max="80" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="shoulder_width_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="30" max="80" value="45" data-pair-range data-sync="shoulder_width_cm" aria-label="Shoulder width slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Hip width (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="hip_width_cm" min="30" max="80" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="hip_width_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="30" max="80" value="45" data-pair-range data-sync="hip_width_cm" aria-label="Hip width slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Hand length (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="hand_length_cm" min="10" max="30" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="hand_length_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="10" max="30" value="20" data-pair-range data-sync="hand_length_cm" aria-label="Hand length slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="input-pair" data-input-pair>
            <div class="input-pair__head">
              <span class="field__label">Foot length (cm)</span>
              <span class="input-pair__chip" data-percentile data-unit="cm">Percentile —</span>
            </div>
            <div class="input-pair__controls">
              <input type="number" name="foot_length_cm" min="15" max="35" required inputmode="decimal" data-pair-input data-sync="foot_length_cm" />
              <input type="range" min="15" max="35" value="25" data-pair-range data-sync="foot_length_cm" aria-label="Foot length slider (centimeters)" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--past" data-past-sports>
        <span class="coach-ribbon coach-ribbon--muted">Step 3 · Past experience</span>
        <div class="intake-card__header">
          <h2>Past sports</h2>
          <p>Share up to five sports you’ve played. Signed-in users blend this into future matches.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intake-card__actions">
          <span class="past-sports__count" data-past-count>0 / 5</span>
          <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-past-add>Add sport</button>
        </div>
        <p class="intake-card__empty" data-past-empty>Log in to add past sports and experiences.</p>
        <div class="past-sports__items" data-past-items></div>
        <template data-past-template>
          <div class="past-sport-item" data-item>
            <label class="field">
              <span class="field__label">Sport or discipline</span>
              <div class="past-sport-picker" data-picker>
                <input type="text" class="past-sport-picker__input" data-field="sport_label" placeholder="Search sports…" autocomplete="off" />
                <input type="hidden" data-field="sport_subcategory_id" />
                <div class="past-sport-picker__results" data-search-results hidden></div>
              </div>
            </label>
            <div class="input-row">
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Years played</span>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" min="0" max="80" data-field="years_played" />
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Starting age</span>
                <input type="number" min="0" max="80" data-field="age_started_years" />
              </label>
            </div>
            <label class="field">
              <span class="field__label">Intensity</span>
              <select data-field="intensity">
                <option value="">Select</option>
                <option value="light">Casual / recreational</option>
                <option value="moderate">Regular weekly sessions</option>
                <option value="intense">Competitive season</option>
                <option value="elite">High performance / elite</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <div class="past-sport-flags">
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Enjoyed it?</span>
                <select data-field="liked">
                  <option value="">Select</option>
                  <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                  <option value="no">No</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Felt natural?</span>
                <select data-field="had_flair">
                  <option value="">Select</option>
                  <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                  <option value="no">No</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Became good at it?</span>
                <select data-field="achieved_skill">
                  <option value="">Select</option>
                  <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                  <option value="no">No</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
          </div>
        </template>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--premium-locked" data-premium-locked>
        <div class="premium-lock">
          <div class="premium-lock__header">
            <span class="premium-lock__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
            <div>
              <h2 class="premium-lock__title">Premium analysis (paid)</h2>
              <p class="premium-lock__copy" data-premium-locked-message>
                Premium credits let you capture preferences, goals, and injuries alongside your measurements. Sign in and apply a credit to unlock deeper tailoring.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="premium-lock__actions">
            <button type="button" class="button button--sm" data-auth-open data-auth-mode="signin">Log in</button>
            <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-auth-open data-auth-mode="signup">Create account</button>
            <a class="button--ghost button--sm" href="/pricing">View pricing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--premium" data-premium-block hidden>
        <div class="premium-block">
          <div class="premium-header">
            <span class="premium-header__badge">Premium analysis</span>
            <h2 class="section__subtitle" style="margin:0;">Tell us what matters most</h2>
            <p class="premium-note">Add up to 20 entries per category. We’ll blend these with your measurements for the detailed analysis.</p>
            <p class="premium-note" data-premium-summary></p>
            <div class="premium-toggle" data-premium-toggle hidden>
              <label class="toggle">
                <input type="checkbox" data-premium-apply />
                <span class="toggle__track"></span>
              </label>
              <div class="premium-toggle__copy">
                <p class="premium-toggle__title">Apply one adult analysis credit</p>
                <p class="premium-toggle__hint">Switch on when you’re ready to run the detailed analysis. Turn it off to stick with the free quick match.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="premium-groups">
            <div class="premium-group" data-list="preferences">
              <div class="premium-group__header">
                <div>
                  <h3>Preferences</h3>
                  <p class="premium-note">Training environments, team dynamics, or settings you gravitate toward.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="premium-actions">
                  <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="preference">Add preference</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
              <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 preferences.</p>
              <template data-template>
                <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Preference</span>
                    <select data-field="preference_id" required></select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Priority</span>
                    <select data-field="priority">
                      <option value="must_have">Must-have</option>
                      <option value="nice_to_have">Nice-to-have</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>

            <div class="premium-group" data-list="goals">
              <div class="premium-group__header">
                <div>
                  <h3>Goals</h3>
                  <p class="premium-note">What you want sport to deliver—skills, fitness, or lifestyle outcomes.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="premium-actions">
                  <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="goal">Add goal</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
              <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 goals.</p>
              <template data-template>
                <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Goal</span>
                    <select data-field="goal_id" required></select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Priority</span>
                    <select data-field="priority">
                      <option value="must_have">Must-have</option>
                      <option value="nice_to_have">Nice-to-have</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>

            <div class="premium-group" data-list="injuries">
              <div class="premium-group__header">
                <div>
                  <h3>Injuries</h3>
                  <p class="premium-note">Flag current or past injuries so we can adjust intensity and recommendations.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="premium-actions">
                  <span class="premium-count" data-count>0 / 20</span>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-add="injury">Add injury</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="premium-group__items" data-items></div>
              <p class="premium-empty" data-empty>None added yet. Add up to 20 injuries.</p>
              <template data-template>
                <div class="premium-item" data-item>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Injury</span>
                    <select data-field="injury_id" required></select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Specific area</span>
                    <select data-field="injury_subcategory_id">
                      <option value="">General</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field__label">Severity</span>
                    <select data-field="severity">
                      <option value="severe">Severe</option>
                      <option value="somewhat_bad">Somewhat bad</option>
                      <option value="mostly_healed">Mostly healed</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field premium-item__note">
                    <span class="field__label">Notes (optional)</span>
                    <input type="text" data-field="notes" maxlength="160" placeholder="Rehab status, triggers, limits" />
                  </label>
                  <button type="button" class="button--ghost button--sm" data-remove>Remove</button>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-card intake-card--submit" data-submit-anchor>
        <div class="intake-card__header">
          <h2>Ready to see your matches?</h2>
          <p class="privacy-note">We don’t store your data unless you log in and consent. Measurements sent to the backend are processed securely.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-status aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="button-row">
          <button class="button" type="submit" data-submit>See my matches</button>
          <a class="button--ghost" href="/privacy">Privacy policy (draft)</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </form>

    <aside class="intake-aside">
      <h2 class="section__subtitle">Tips for accurate measuring</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use a flexible measuring tape and stand tall without shoes.</li>
        <li>Arm span: fingertip to fingertip, arms extended level with shoulders.</li>
        <li>Leg inseam: heel to inner thigh crease—use a book to mark the spot.</li>
        <li>Shoulder width: outer edge to outer edge of shoulders.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <div class="intake-sticky" data-sticky-submit hidden>
    <div class="intake-sticky__inner">
      <span class="intake-sticky__label">Ready? Run the quick match.</span>
      <button type="button" class="button button--sm" data-sticky-button>See my matches</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>
        <strong>Need help measuring?</strong>
        <p class="lead-copy">We’ll add video guides soon. For now, keep a flexible measuring tape handy and stand tall without shoes.</p>
      </div>
      <small>© <span id="year">2025</span> Sporty</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2" defer></script>
    <script src="/config.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/app.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/intake.js" defer></script>
    <script>
      const yearEl = document.getElementById('year');
      if (yearEl) {
        yearEl.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());
      }
    </script>
  </Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
